Z||000000||Pretender||09-21-2000||05:40 AM||||While i was doing some grocery shopping the new roadNtrack cought my eye, a 350hp nortstar powered seville*i think* with huge 14 inch crossdrilled brakes and i guess everything else to back it up with is going to be coming out soon. first thing that came to my mind was wow! what an awesome brake upgrade that would be. then of coarse it hit me....A 350hp northstar in my fiero(hypnotises fiero)...just thought i'd let you guys know that there is now a better northstar out there. L8r, shawn. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||HugGRRRFiero||09-21-2000||08:50 AM||||That's the Seville that paced the 24 Heures Du Mans race this year.  It was hopped up and tuned for performance, pretty cool what you can do with an unlimited budget.  Can't say if they are bumping the HP for production Northstars, but I imagine they will soon.  <P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">        <BR>        <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
